{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BkxrxoWwM9sez3ed6jLHiF","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I found the dream-review-full skill file and read its complete contents. Here's what I found:\n\n**File Location:** `/home/ubuntu/agent-ml-research/skills/global/dream-review-full.skill.md`\n\n**Summary:**\nThis is a skill file that defines the complete review template for Dream-simulated papers using a 2-Reviewer roundtable approach in full review mode. Key aspects include:\n\n- **Purpose:** Provides a structured protocol for reviewing dream-simulated papers with 2 reviewers who divide work by expertise dimension\n- **Reviewer Roles:**\n  - Reviewer 1: Focus on methodology and experiments\n  - Reviewer 2: Focus on novelty and related work\n  \n- **Process:** 4-step protocol:\n  - Step 1: Dispatch (separate reviewer assignments)\n  - Step 2: Cross-share (reviewers review each other's findings)\n  - Step 3: Convergence judgment (determine if consensus is reached)\n  - Step 4: Synthesis submission (combine findings into final report)\n\n- **Key Differences from Simple Mode:** Includes cross-sharing and convergence steps with 2 reviewers vs. 1 in simple mode\n- **Constraints:** No format reviewer (unlike normal reviews), no issue tracker writes, no external review, one-time session (no continue mode)\n\nThe file is in Chinese with English technical terms and provides detailed dispatch templates, step-by-step instructions, and fallback procedures for reviewer timeouts."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c5d45d1f-fe22-4182-a38c-18f940056636","uuid":"40a48348-ff30-459f-bbf2-31c2a0a7757b","timestamp":"2026-05-12T02:52:10.886Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Find the dream-review-full skill file. Search for files matching patterns like \"dream-review-full.skill.md\" or \"dream-review*.skill.md\" or any skill file containing \"dream-review-full\" in directories like /home/ubuntu/agent-