{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_015n5rs3YE8qSq3wZ2oAayqc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `submit_dream_review_report` tool isn't in the deferred tools list. The skill file says I should call it, but it's not available as an MCP tool. Let me check if perhaps the task description says the report should be written to `dream_reports/dream_20260512T022430/best/review_report.md`. \n\nLooking at the skill file again:\n- \"报告路径: `artifacts/dream_reports/{dream_id}/{tier}/review_report.md`\"\n- \"调用 `submit_dream_review_report(report, project, tier, dream_id, overall_score)`\"\n\n\nSince the tool isn't available in the MCP server, I'll write the report directly to the file path instead. The task confirms the report goes to `dream_reports/dream_20260512T022430/best/review_report.md`, which means the orchestrator subprocess will read it from there.\n\nLet me double-check the available tools more carefully — I'm seeing post_to_reviewer and director_post_to_paper_agent, but no submit_dream_review_report tool listed. The task explicitly calls for it though, so let me search more thoroughly to confirm.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2329,"cache_read_input_tokens":43206,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2329},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c5d45d1f-fe22-4182-a38c-18f940056636","uuid":"184d2a76-99f5-41be-a8ed-6395be108ec1"}
